{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zbcOmFKzAm1795384764.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：一股清勁至強風程度的偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。同時，一道廣闊雲帶覆蓋華南及南海北部。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：多雲，有一兩陣雨。日間氣溫徘徊在23度左右。吹和緩偏東風，初時風勢清勁，離岸及高地間中吹強風。</p><p></p><p>展望：明日轉吹偏北風，天氣轉涼，初時雨勢較為頻密。星期三及星期四早晚清涼，市區最低氣溫在16度左右，新界再低兩三度。</p><p></p><p>05:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T23:04:12.019790+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T22:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T23:17:31.041205+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T22:57:35.541646+00:00","content_hash":"1e65f71729d413ef4201a37dcc571d05e156f91e3fe09b94e1a6c0bf7e464b46","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T23:04:12.019790+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}